\newlabel{fig:partial}{{3}{5}{$128\times 128$-bit multiplication as sixteen $32\times 32$ partial products --- long multiplication scaled to 128-bit limbs. Each $A_i B_j$ term maps to one \texttt {MUL} in base RV64I\@; rows shift left by 32 bits per $B$ limb index. The 256-bit result $P_0$--$P_7$ is exact with no intermediate rounding}{figure.caption.4}{}}
